  m_text: "\u2022 Move with <color=#FF4D4D><b>WASD</b> / <b>Arrow Keys</b></color>.\n\u2022
    Collect <color=#F7C948>all</color> coins in the maze to unlock the blue door.\n\u2022
    Enter the <color=#3DA5FF>blue</color> door to access the <color=#3DA5FF>Dark
    Maze</color>.\n\u2022 Light up all <color=#F7C948>beacons</color> in the Dark
    Maze to reveal the <color=#4CAF50>key</color>.\n\u2022 Collect the key to teleport
    back to the <color=#F7C948>original maze</color>.\n\u2022 Exit through the <color=#4CAF50>orange</color>
    door to finish the level.\n\nPress <b>R</b> to restart.\n"
